  "description": "Fuselage: White. Cheatlines: Horizon's 1981 stripes from the nose to the tail cone along the window line's bottom: orange over red-orange over burgundy, sweeping down under the cockpit at the nose. Tail: White with Horizon's 'meatball', an orange setting sun in two oranges over a red and burgundy base, split by a thin white line. Engines: White. Winglets: Burgundy and orange stripes. Titles: The 2016 'Alaska' wordmark in dark navy over the stripes forward; 'HORIZON AIR' in white capitals on the orange band right after it. Colors hex: not published; matched by eye.",
